// The ten stress cases (ROADMAP Q-029; docs/design-handoff.md "Stress cases every design must survive"). Generated by
// tools/stress-gen.mjs: the nine committed ones must equal a fresh generation byte for byte, the 4,000-file one is
// generated here and never committed. Each renders headless at every level of detail with the meter balanced, and
// what each case tests has a geometry check on the frame actually built (svg text, plus the layout rects at that zoom).
// What geometry cannot judge (legibility) goes to a screenshot critic pass, not here.
// Run: node tools/stress.test.mjs
